<title>USA: Lucent Technologies Inc Q2 March 31 net.</title>
<headline>Lucent Technologies Inc Q2 March 31 net.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Income Statement (Unaudited)</p>
<p>	   Millions of dollars, except per share amounts</p>
<p>						 Q2 Ended</p>
<p>					  3/31/97    3/31/96  Change</p>
<p> Revenues				 5,149	4,577  12.5%</p>
<p> Costs				    2,981	2,753   8.3%</p>
<p> Gross Margin			   2,168	1,824  18.9%</p>
<p>    Selling, General and	    1,287	1,341  (4.0)%</p>
