<p>The number of outstanding shares for the quarter ended March 31, 1997, was computed on a weighted average share basis including common stock equivalents.</p>
<p>The number of outstanding shares for the quarter ended March 31, 1996, was computed on a pro forma basis using the 636.7 million shares that were outstanding after the Initial Public Offering of 112 million shares in April 1996.</p>
<p>Weighted average loss per share was $0.20 for the quarter ended March 31, 1996, on a weighted average share basis using 524.7 million shares.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
